      "key": "descri",
      "label": "Description",
      "searchable": true,
      "value": "The Regions and Locals series (1968-1982) contains limited amounts of correspondence, financial records, tax forms, and organizational materials from local units of PATCO. In addition to region-specific correspondence, this series contains materials devoted to the regional seminars organized by PATCO to educate its membership (1974-1976) and a regional public relations manual to help local union leaders deal effectively with the press in their areas. Several sections of this series deal indirectly with the 1981 Strike, including several folders of region correspondence (1981-1982). See Series XI: Regions and Locals finding aid for complete description."
    },
